toll4.js, v2.73 vs v2.74, the audit's pairs. Every count in the CHANGELOG reproduces exactly:
- sea cells read as claimed: 0 of 12 258 and 0 of 10 939;
- unclaimed land read as claimed: 0 of 152 and 0 of 7 235;
- 12 of 77 and 41 of 84 stages change tier, all Coastal Waters or Sheltered Bay, Sparse Settlements → Ruined Region, with no land stage changed;
- all six of seed 777's journeys go from 0 to 1 border and from 0 to 6 toll.

The seed-12345 day list "12.7 → 14.1, 14.3 → 14.9, 16.6 → 16.8, 17.6 → 17.8, 19.8 → 20.3, 18.3 → 18.5" mixes two measures:
- the first is totalDays (travel time 10.7 → 12.1, plus rest days);
- the other five are the travel days of journeys whose plan is impassable: jpJourneyCost returns null and totalDays is null.

Seed 777's six figures are totalDays. Nothing in the text says which is which, or that five routes are impassable.

